      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Here you can edit your garden by planting new seeds.


    Press the corresponding
    keys, <b>A-Z</b>, to plant a new seed.


    You can only plant seeds you can
    afford.


    Press <b>return</b> to pay for the new seeds and play the garden.


    Press
    <b>space</b> to cancel editing the garden and go back to the main menu.'
